  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "土壤物理與沖蝕",
    "sub_ename": "SOIL PHYSICS AND EROSION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之主要目的在於介紹土壤之物理特性、其它物質在土壤內之移動方式、影響土壤沖蝕之主要因素、土壤沖蝕特性（類型、過程）、以及相關土壤沖蝕預測及控制技術。除使同學瞭解土壤資源之基本特性外，亦提供同學準備水土保持技師及高考所須具備之專業知識，以為爾後執行相關水保業務作準備。",
    "describe_eh": " This course introduces the physical characteristics of soil, movement of other materials in the soil, major factors and characteristics of soil erosion, and related prediction and control techniques of soil erosion.  It not only provides the concepts about soil resources, but also helps students to have the necessary knowledge as professional engineers or public servants of soil and water conservation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能夠使用主要參數以顯示土壤之一般物理特性\t",
      "describe_en": "The learners can apply major parameters to define the general physical characteristics of soil."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能夠以自己的辭彙定義土壤沖蝕之基本概念\t",
      "describe_en": "The learners can define the fundamental concepts of soil erosion by their own vocabularies."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "\t能夠描述造成土壤沖蝕之各種因素\n",
      "describe_en": "3Students can describe the factors of causing soil erosion. \n"
    }
  ],
