    "tpb_book": "<div>1.基礎土壤物理學，1987</div>\n\n<div>2.土壤沖蝕，游繁結編，中興大學水土保持系課程講義。</div>\n\n<div>3.行政院農業委員會，2005，水土保持手冊。（坡-1_蝕溝處理、坡-3_蝕溝控制、坡-2_坡地防風、植-5_防風定砂）</div>\n\n<div>4.Troeh, F.R., J.A. Hobbs, &amp; R.L. Donahue. 1999. Soil erosion and conservation: Productivity and environmental protection, 3rd ed., Prentice-Hall Inc. (Chapter 5)</div>\n",
